0..58 Comment "//! `natural` refuses invalid region-polymorphism squares."
59..62 Comment "//!"
63..142 Comment "//! A reversed widening changes the required type. Two different functions have"
143..223 Comment "//! unequal endpoints. The checker reports `TypeMismatch` or `EndpointMismatch`."
224..227 Comment "//!"
228..307 Comment "//! The source applies model `pass` and `touch`. It imports the early exit host"
308..322 Comment "//! interface."
